  "html": "<main class=\"lr-dashboard\" aria-label=\"Restaurante\"><p class=\"lr-intro\">Gestiona tu operación de restaurante: ventas, mesas, comandas, cocina y más.</p><div class=\"lr-panel\">\n<section class=\"lr-section\" aria-labelledby=\"lr-section-0\"><header class=\"lr-section-header\"><span class=\"lr-section-icon lr-section-icon-featured\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v5a2 2 0 0 0 4 0V3M5 3v18M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0ZM21 3c-2 2-3 4-3 7h3V3Zm0 7v11\"/></svg></span><div><h2 id=\"lr-section-0\">Operación diaria</h2><p>Gestiona la atención de tus clientes y la operación del restaurante.</p></div></header><div class=\"lr-grid\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"pos\" title=\"Punto de venta de restaurante\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><span class=\"lr-font-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Punto de venta</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Realiza ventas, gestiona cuentas y toma pedidos.</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"accounts\" title=\"Cuentas\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M2.5 3.722c0-.454.316-.722.59-.722h9.82c.274 0 .59.268.59.722v8.556c0 .454-.316.722-.59.722H3.09c-.274 0-.59-.268-.59-.722V3.722zM3.09 2c-.93 0-1.59.826-1.59 1.722v8.556c0 .896.66 1.722 1.59 1.722h9.82c.