troke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Comandas</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Gestiona las comandas de cocina y pedidos.</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"kitchen\" title=\"Cocina KDS\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><span class=\"lr-font-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Cocina KDS</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Visualiza y gestiona los pedidos en cocina (KDS).</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"lr-section\" aria-labelledby=\"lr-section-1\"><header class=\"lr-section-header\"><span class=\"lr-section-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M18 6H6m-1 5v8.318a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5H11a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5V17a1 1 0 0 1 1-1H14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3.318a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h2a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5V11\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" /><path d=\"M18.546 6.2L21 9.4V11H3V9.4l2.455-3.2V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h11.09a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2.2z\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M7.5 15.5v-1h1v1h-1z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" /></svg></span><div><h2 id=\"lr-section-1\">Catálogo</h2><p>Administra tus productos, platillos y precios.</p></div></header><div class=\"lr-grid\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"items\" title=\"Productos y platillos\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v5a2 2 0 0 0 4 0V3M5 3v18M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0ZM21 3c-2 2-3 4-3 7h3V3Zm0 7v11\"/></svg></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Productos y platillos</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Crea y gestiona productos, platillos y modificadores.</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"groups\" title=\"Categorías y subcategorías\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><span class=\"lr-font-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Categorías y subcategorías</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Organiza tu menú por categorías y subcategorías.</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"lr-card\" data-action=\"prices\" title=\"Precios de productos\"><span class=\"lr-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stro