5.32727C12.047 5.45583 11.9626 5.6191 11.9305 5.79604C11.8985 5.97299 11.9201 6.15548 11.9927 6.32V6.36364C12.0619 6.52497 12.1767 6.66255 12.323 6.75947C12.4694 6.85638 12.6408 6.90839 12.8164 6.90909H12.9091C13.1984 6.90909 13.4759 7.02403 13.6805 7.22861C13.8851 7.4332 14 7.71067 14 8C14 8.28933 13.8851 8.5668 13.6805 8.77139C13.4759 8.97597 13.1984 9.09091 12.9091 9.09091H12.86C12.6845 9.09161 12.513 9.14362 12.3667 9.24053C12.2203 9.33745 12.1055 9.47504 12.0364 9.63636V9.63636Z\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span><span class=\"lr-card-copy\"><span class=\"lr-card-title\">Configuración</span><span class=\"lr-card-description\">Ajusta mesas, turnos, áreas, impresoras y otras preferencias.</span></span><span class=\"lr-chevron\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4.25 9.5L7.75 6L4.25 2.5\" stroke=\"var(--icon-stroke)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg></span></button>\n</div></section>\n</div></main>",
